<title>HONG KONG: Simsen Metals 16-months net HK$3.97 mln.</title>
<headline>Simsen Metals 16-months net HK$3.97 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>16-months ended April 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.9	vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 4.39 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    3.97     vs 16.27</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,405.32 vs 2,048.33</p>
<p>    Company name		 Simsen Metals (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A trader of nonferrous metals and ores, mainly copper, aluminium and nickel.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to April 30 from December 31. Comparative figures are for the 12 months ended December 31, 1994.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
